"<script id=\"homepage-deferred-images\">\n(()=>{\n const load=(img)=>{if(!img?.dataset.deferredSrc)return;img.loading='eager';img.src=img.dataset.deferredSrc;delete img.dataset.deferredSrc;};\n const hydrate=(area)=>{area.querySelectorAll('img[data-deferred-src]').forEach(load);};\n const areas=[document.getElementById('people'),document.getElementById('how')].filter(Boolean);\n if('IntersectionObserver' in window){\n  const observer=new IntersectionObserver(entries=>{entries.forEach(e=>{if(e.isIntersecting){hydrate(e.target);observer.unobserve(e.target);}});},{rootMargin:'300px 0px'});\n  areas.forEach(area=>observer.observe(area));\n }else{areas.forEach(hydrate);}\n // A deep-link or instant scroll can select a scene before its observer callback.\n const recover=new MutationObserver(()=>{document.querySelectorAll('.people-visual.current img[data-deferred-src],.scene-art.active[data-deferred-src]').forEach(img=>{const area=img.closest('section');if(area&&area.getBoundingClientRect().top<innerHeight+300&&area.getBoundingClientRect().bottom>-300)load(img);});});\n areas.forEach(area=>recover.observe(area,{attributes:true,subtree:true,attributeFilter:['class']}));\n})();\n</script>"
